LIMITATION TheMachineBreakdownIgnoresOptimizerBoost
	SYMPTOM "The production breakdown by machine uses base levels only, without the boost of"
		+ "optimizers and fuses: once a fuse is in play the totalLevel of the entries sums below"
		+ "production, and their productionRatio shares do not sum to 1"
	UNTIL @TASK.FIX113
	SEEN_IN "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/PlanetEnergyGrid.ts::private"
		+ "productionBreakdown(production: number)"
	APPLIES_TO_PACKAGE @PACKAGE.core_mapping
	RATIONALE "It is the counterpart of counting the boost once, in the contribution of the"
		+ "optimizer, so as not to count it twice in the planet energy grid. A code comment carried"
		+ "it until the move to PlanetEnergyGrid removed it"
		REF @DECISION.APlanetEnergyGridIsAnAggregate
	SOURCE "Found on 2026-09-13 while moving the energy rules into PlanetEnergyGrid"
		PR 72

LIMITATION ADecorativeIconInAViewModelValueIsReadAloud
	STATUS archived
	ARCHIVED_ON 2026-09-24
	SYMPTOM "A screen reader announces the name of the construction icon in every consumption and"
		+ "available cell, and in the title of the consumption grid"
	UNTIL "the icon is taken out of the work-in-progress label in both message modules"
	SEEN_IN "packages/core-mapping/src/presentation/messages/energyLevelsSectionMessages.js::export"
		+ "const energyLevelsSectionWorkInProgressLabel"
	SEEN_IN "packages/ui-save-manager/src/messages/energyLevelsSectionMessages.js::export const"
		+ "energyLevelsSectionWorkInProgressLabel"
	SEEN_IN "packages/core-mapping/src/presentation/EnergyLevelsPresenter.ts::${energyLevelsSectionKilowattUnit}"
		+ "${energyLevelsSectionWorkInProgressLabel}"
	APPLIES_TO_PACKAGE @PACKAGE.ui_save_manager
	APPLIES_TO_PACKAGE @PACKAGE.core_mapping
	RATIONALE "energyLevelsSectionWorkInProgressLabel carries the icon in the string itself and"
		+ "EnergyLevelsPresenter sews it into ViewModel values the UI renders as text, out of reach"
		+ "of the Icon component. The ruling on decorative characters does not cover this case: it"
		+ "assumes the character is a JSX node, which a ViewModel value is not. The label is"
		+ "declared twice, in the messages of core-mapping and in those of the UI, so both change"
		+ "together"
		REF @DECISION.ADecorativeCharacterIsRenderedByIcon
	SOURCE "Found on 2026-09-14 in the review of pull request 71"
		PR 71

LIMITATION TheHtmlDocumentOfTheSiteCarriesNoSecurityHeader
	STATUS archived
	ARCHIVED_ON 2026-09-23
	SYMPTOM "The HTML document of the production web UI carries no Content-Security-Policy,"
		+ "Referrer-Policy nor Permissions-Policy: another site may frame it, and nothing restricts"
		+ "a script injected into it"
	UNTIL @TASK.FIX101
	SEEN_IN "packages/ui-save-manager/public/_headers::Content-Security-Policy"
	APPLIES_TO_PACKAGE @PACKAGE.ui_save_manager
	RATIONALE "Netlify applies _headers to the static files it serves, not to the responses of the"
		+ "function that renders the document: the headers were written as if the site were static"
	SOURCE "Measured with curl -I on the production site and on the local build on 2026-09-23"

LIMITATION EachCliDuplicatesItsVersionAndUnknownArgumentRendering
	SYMPTOM "renderVersion and renderUnknownArguments are written twice, once in cli-merge and once"
		+ "in cli-validate, and fallow reports the pair as a clone group unless its reviewed key is"
		+ "listed"
	WORKAROUND "The clone group is listed as reviewed under its exact key in fallow.toml, which"
		+ "lapses as soon as either copy changes or a third copy appears; a change to one copy is"
		+ "made to the other"
	UNTIL "a package the dependency matrix lets both cli-* packages import can hold terminal"
		+ "rendering, or a third CLI needs the same lines"
	SEEN_IN "packages/cli-merge/cli/renderMergeCliOutput.js::renderVersion"
	SEEN_IN "packages/cli-validate/cli/renderValidateCliOutput.js::renderVersion"
	SEEN_IN "fallow.toml::ignoredClones"
	APPLIES_TO_PACKAGE @PACKAGE.cli_merge
	APPLIES_TO_PACKAGE @PACKAGE.cli_validate
	RATIONALE "No shared home is allowed today: a shared-* package holds no UI concern (ARCH-SHR-2)"
		+ "and terminal output is the presentation of a CLI, and a cli-* package may depend only on"
		+ "shared-*, util-* and core-* packages, so neither CLI can import the other's rendering."
		+ "Ignoring the rendering files for duplication was rejected: every later clone there would"
		+ "go unseen, where the reviewed key lapses on its own"
		REF @DECISION.BothCliEntryFilesRunThroughOneSharedFunction
	SOURCE "Pull request review, the owner asking for the fallow warnings to be resolved, then for"
		+ "the kept duplication to be recorded as a limitation rather than a decision"
		PR 135

LIMITATION TheContentSecurityPolicyAllowsEval
	STATUS archived
	ARCHIVED_ON 2026-09-24
	SYMPTOM "the content security policy of the web UI allows 'unsafe-eval' in script-src: a string"
		+ "an injected script hands to eval or new Function runs despite it"
	UNTIL @TASK.FIX104
	SEEN_IN "packages/ui-save-manager/public/_headers::'unsafe-eval'"
	SEEN_IN "packages/core-mapping/src/infrastructure/validateSchemas.js::getSchema(sectionSchemaId)"
	APPLIES_TO_PACKAGE @PACKAGE.ui_save_manager
	RATIONALE "Ajv compiles each section validator with new Function in the browser: measured in"
